+## 2026-09-15 — Pong RTX 5090 locked replication launched
+
+Native PufferLib PongCNN; point fraction is not match win rate. Local source commit `1d9e9e0dca88706c7a8495644c8dc584a4446f11`; frozen protocol SHA256 `7627852d943d2b2777db6fd6874cd6eaffaca64c8a6a95b6c6acd44771125571`.
+
+Run: `build/pongcnn/confirm-5090.full.JXYKB06r`; tmux `pong-5090-replication`. [Frozen protocol](../build/pongcnn/confirm-5090.full.JXYKB06r/protocol.json), [planned jobs and eventual receipts](../build/pongcnn/confirm-5090.full.JXYKB06r/jobs.json), [handoff](PONG_5090_HANDOFF.md), [runner documentation](../ocean/pongcnn/CONFIRMATION.md).
+
+Four unchanged encoders x two shared learner recipes x seeds 31001–31005; paired evaluation seeds 41001–41005. Each job has 4,194,304 decisions and eight checkpoints, 512 requested full matches per checkpoint: 40 training jobs / 320 evaluations planned. Training/evaluation caps remain 1800/300 seconds. Native integer replay semantics give 1/3 updates per rollout while preserving the prescribed floating recipe values.
+
+Validation passed: CPU parity/pixel/sanitizer suite, four existing config tests, nine new runner tests, all eight final canary jobs and 32 evaluations. All 32 checkpoint pairs across two canaries are byte-identical. Completed resume is a verified no-op. [Archived canary and validation](results/pongcnn/confirm-5090.canary.9ZnvPpBA/REPORT.md). Fourteen native core/encoder hashes match the prior 5090 numerical audit; no native kernels, environment rules or architecture changed.
+
+Full campaign is running, not yet a result. Canary-based estimate is about 120 minutes with substantial uncertainty in learned-policy evaluation duration. Startup was verified once; training is left unattended. The launcher automatically appends completion totals/final means here and writes the full observed-frontier analysis, paired whole-seed bootstrap intervals, raw failure/missing-data accounting, evidence archive SHA256 and `TRANSFER.txt` SCP command in the run directory. Original Connect4 results and all failed preparation/packaging attempts remain preserved locally.
